  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Agro-ecology Alliance to Promote Sustainable Cashew Nut in Cambodia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Agro-ecology Alliance to Promote Sustainable Cashew Nut in Cambodia aims to improve the capacities and the effectiveness of Civil Society Organisations (CSOs) to fulfil their missions, thus contributing to the Global Objective of Lot 1 of the call for proposal. The main targeted CSOs are Agricultural Cooperatives (AC) representing small-scale family farming in two provinces of Kampong Thom and Preah Vihear, but also Cambodian organisations such as local CSOs, multi-stakeholder platforms, and business associations involving in the cashew nut value-chain.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
